            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The request for excused absence must be submitted using OPM Form 71, Request for Leave or Approved Absence, and must be accompanied with written documentation from the VA to verify that the appointment meets the criteria set forth in this section. Each request for excused absence must be submitted separately.",
