        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. The technician is responsible for providing the required documentation to justify an excused absence request IAW this section. Excused absence cannot be granted unless the criteria in paragraph 3 a-d are satisfied. When the criteria cannot be satisfied prior to attending a VA medical appointment, the Employee shall be placed in an appropriate leave status to cover the period of absence. However, a technician may subsequently provide the required documentation at which point their time and attendance record shall be promptly corrected to reflect the appropriate duty status.",
            "block_bbox": [
